Subject: [RFC PATCH 17/34] riscv: mm: use proper set_pXd() for generic compile-time folded patable in vmalloc_fault()
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 14:55:56 +0100
Message-ID: <20260713135614.1618183-18-yeoreum.yun@arm.com>
